CHECKLIST.md

# Python bytecode cache -- shows up under bin/ whenever a .py script here gets
# run directly with a bare `python`/`python3` (e.g. ad-hoc syntax checks); never
# needed, never intentional. Set PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX=<some dir outside any repo>
# to stop it from being written here at all, if you'd rather avoid even the
# untracked-file clutter than rely on this ignore rule.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
